{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02677","headline":"别徐永元秀才 · 孔绍安","name":"别徐永元秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金汤既失险，玉石乃同焚。\n坠叶还相覆，落羽更爲羣。\n岂谓三秋节，重伤千里分。\n远离弦易转，幽咽水难闻。\n欲识相思处，山川间白云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孔绍安","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02677.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02677","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}